# Breaking out of Death House after refusing the altar. The front door is brick; the dining room's tall window is
# the last way out, closing course by course. Started by the tall_window prop (death_house_ground). Grants the
# level 3 milestone and ends the Death House quest; the window exit opens once death_house_completed is set.

~ window
narrate examine:tall_window
if flag.death_house_window_attempted
  -> window_through
endif
set death_house_window_attempted
Narrator: Every other window in the house is brick now. This one is still closing, wet brick climbing the glass row by row. At the top there is a gap the width of a person. For now.
* [Athletics DC 12] Smash the glass and haul everyone up through the gap. -> window_through | window_guard
* [Acrobatics DC 12] Up the window seat, through the gap, and pull the others after you. -> window_through | window_guard

~ window_guard
Narrator: The glass holds one heartbeat too long. Behind you, the dining room's silver lifts off the sideboard with a sound like a breath let out.
combat window_last_guard

~ window_through
Narrator: Glass bursts outward and the soft brick crumbles with it, leaving a ragged gap onto grey daylight and the weeds of the lot. Behind you, every door in the house slams at once, like applause.
if flag.death_house_lorghoth_slain
  Narrator: Somewhere far below, the thing you killed is already rotting into the heap it came from. The house will grow another. It can wait.
endif
if flag.death_house_children_riding
  Narrator: As you reach the gap, two small cold weights tear out of two of you and are dragged back into the dark, crying. The house keeps what it owns.
  set death_house_children_riding = false
endif
set death_house_completed
quest death_house escaped_refused
xp milestone
interject name:ilse_varga: Through. Now. We count off on the other side.
interject name:tamsin_tealeaf: Out. Out is my favorite direction. Out forever.
interject name:hedda_ironvow: Go, go. Dawn's out there somewhere. Late, but out there.
interject name:silvain_aster: I would like it noted that I said the house was hungry.
if not name:ilse_varga
  interject class:fighter: Move! Nobody stops until we're out!
endif
-> END
